@base = http://localhost:8080

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### List all products
GET {{base}}/products

### Full-text search (ranked)
GET {{base}}/products?search=wireless%20headphones

### Tag filter (array containment)
GET {{base}}/products?tag=usb-c

### JSONB spec filter
GET {{base}}/products?specKey=color&specValue=black

### One product
GET {{base}}/products/1

### One JSONB value
GET {{base}}/products/3/specs/battery_hours

### Create a product (fires a LISTEN/NOTIFY event)
POST {{base}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "KB-101",
  "name": "Compact Keyboard",
  "description": "60% mechanical keyboard with hot-swappable switches.",
  "price": 89.99,
  "stock": 15,
  "category": "Accessories",
  "tags": ["keyboard", "mechanical", "compact"],
  "specs": { "layout": "60%", "switch": "linear" }
}

### Create an order (idempotent — replay with the same key to get the original)
POST {{base}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: order-2026-11-15-001

{
  "productId": 1,
  "quantity": 2
}

### EF Core vs Dapper, same query, timed
GET {{base}}/compare?search=wireless

### Recent LISTEN/NOTIFY events
GET {{base}}/notifications
